      "originalText": "Tap to popup the image. If it is an gif can modify the reproduction speed.. \nCan add from local album, they can be gifs. If they are gifs, can select speed as x0.2 x.5 x1 x1.5 x2",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
