      "updated": 1772434123922,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[b] represent the\nbookmark icon,\nbookmarked workouts\nappear first.\n\nIn the programs model\ncreate a string for\nindicating the image for\nrepresenting the card,\nif non selected use the\nfirst workout excercise\nimage to represent the\nworkout\n\n\nshow the first 12\nexcercises images in\nswuares dont have\ntheir description (do\nnot show the breaks)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "81dkLPHE0VTtxMVCA9eli",
      "originalText": "[b] represent the bookmark icon, bookmarked workouts appear first.\n\nIn the programs model create a string for indicating the image for representing the card, if non selected use the first workout excercise image to represent the workout\n\n\nshow the first 12 excercises images in swuares dont have their description (do not show the breaks)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
